+    "line": 225,
+    "text": "Retail: some screens already tell linemen to hold, release and block. Patch: A changes half-second holds to 0.8 seconds; B changes nominal ten-yard QB drops to seven; C sets an explicit 0.6-second pass delay; D combines them. Screens without the full release sequence are listed and left alone. These are experiments, not measured improvements. Requires a disc image and paired play tests."
